Z||000000||Ozzy||03-08-2000||12:04 AM||||Hey Gang...<P>My lil''88 Coupe has been humming like a top here recently. (Hold my breath!!)<P>I purchased the K&N filter for it and a 165 Deg. thermostat. It has been running well but still started to drop off in power just above 4000 rpm. So I installed both of these last night and took it for a buzz.<P>I have read the posts on K&N's before...I don't expect radical improvements from just an air filter but either the thermostat change or filter or both definatley made a noticable improvement!! It pulls pretty clean to 5500 rpms. Never done that before. I dont like to push this engine that hard but thought I'd test it out and it is true.<P>I also constantly *****  about never seeing good deals on Fiero's around here! I pulled the local auto mag. from the rack and see an '85 GT for $2,000.00. This car has a fresh rebuild (133 miles he claims) new suspension parts all around with Eibach (?) springs, new paint, brand new tires and new seats from a Honda Prelude (??? Blasphemy!!)and a new CD player with sub etc. Only catch is it is an auto but I'm still thinking about it. Is the '85 GT a decent car??<P>Ozzy||||reg||10
Z||000001||2M4 Dale||03-08-2000||12:56 AM||||I'll have to try the K&N and the thermostat mods ... see if I can get a little more out of my four banger.<P>I'd just like to have any GT and all Fieros are decent...lol.  $2000.00 with a fresh rebuild...if it's true it's probably a steal!||||reg||1
Z||000002||b_b_a_d||03-08-2000||03:27 AM||||On the issue of it being an Automatic...<P>I have an 86 SE V6 Auto and it Rocks!!!  Gas mileage is lacking a little, but don't think you can't drop it into low just like a stick and take off.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>All my other cars have been stick including my minivan!  I love the control of a manual transmission but I don't feel I have lost any of the fun, control, or power with my Fiero! Best way to find out is to test drive it and see what she can do!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||14
